    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the stillness just feels like waiting to die anyway. watching everything i love break and rot... it feels so heavy. like, if the end is already written, why does it even matter if i'm here to see the worst parts of it? is there really any dignity in just sitting there and letting it all destroy you?",
